","note":"此為元嘉四年廷尉奉詔赴交州，晉75驃騎參軍與王國寶宴者只見同名，未得共事及官序證為同人。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","start_codepoint":111,"end_codepoint":115,"human_reviewed":false,"other_candidate_id":"d8d_ced_96e","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen","source_id":"s-songshu-092-duhongwen-ws2195614"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001:m0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"王徽","kind":"person","person_id":"jj3_a92_7wn","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-songshu-092-duhongwen-1-111","title":"廷尉","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"jj3_a92_7wn","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-092-duhongwen-1-111:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"廷尉","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001:m0113","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen","source_id":"s-songshu-092-duhongwen-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","quote":"以慧度長子員外散騎侍郎弘文為振威將軍、刺史。初，高祖北征關、洛，慧度板弘文為鷹揚將軍，流民督護，配兵三千，北係大軍。行至廣州，關、洛已平，乃歸。統府板弘文行九真太守。及繼父為刺史，亦以寬和得眾，襲爵龍編侯。太祖元嘉四年，以廷尉王徽為交州刺史，弘文就徵。會得重疾，牽以就路，親舊見其患篤，勸表待病瘉，弘文曰：「吾世荷皇恩，杖節三世，常欲投軀帝庭，以報所荷。況親被徵命，而可宴然者乎，如其顛沛，此乃命也。」弘文母既年老，見弘文輿疾就路，不忍分別，相與俱行。到廣州，遂卒。臨死，遣弟弘猷詣京，朝廷甚哀之。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001:m0113"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-songshu-092-duhongwen-1-116","title":"交州刺史","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"jj3_a92_7wn","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-092-duhongwen-1-116:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","start":116,"end":120,"surface":"交州刺史","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001:m0113","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen","source_id":"s-songshu-092-duhongwen-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","quote":"以慧度長子員外散騎侍郎弘文為振威將軍、刺史。初，高祖北征關、洛，慧度板弘文為鷹揚將軍，流民督護，配兵三千，北係大軍。行至廣州，關、洛已平，乃歸。統府板弘文行九真太守。及繼父為刺史，亦以寬和得眾，襲爵龍編侯。太祖元嘉四年，以廷尉王徽為交州刺史，弘文就徵。會得重疾，牽以就路，親舊見其患篤，勸表待病瘉，弘文曰：「吾世荷皇恩，杖節三世，常欲投軀帝庭，以報所荷。況親被徵命，而可宴然者乎，如其顛沛，此乃命也。」弘文母既年老，見弘文輿疾就路，不忍分別，相與俱行。到廣州，遂卒。臨死，遣弟弘猷詣京，朝廷甚哀之。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001:m0113"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-duhongwen:p001","text":"以慧度長子員外散騎侍郎弘文為振威將軍、刺史。初，高祖北征關、洛，慧度板弘文為鷹揚將軍，流民督護，配兵三千，北係大軍。行至廣州，關、洛已平，乃歸。統府板弘文行九真太守。及繼父為刺史，亦以寬和得眾，襲爵龍編侯。太祖元嘉四年，以廷尉王徽為交州刺史，弘文就徵。會得重疾，牽以就路，親舊見其患篤，勸表待病瘉，弘文曰：「吾世荷皇恩，杖節三世，常欲投軀帝庭，以報所荷。況親被徵命，而可宴然者乎，如其顛沛，此乃命也。」弘文母既年老，見弘文輿疾就路，不忍分別，相與俱行。到廣州，遂卒。臨死，遣弟弘猷詣京，朝廷甚哀之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":27,"last_line":27,"raw_start":2331,"raw_end":2580,"raw_character_offsets":[2331,2332,2333,2334,2335,2336,2337,2338,2339,2340,2341,2342,2343,2344,2345,2346,2347,2348,2349,2350,2351,2352,2353,2354,2355,2356,2357,2358,2359,2360,2361,2362,2363,2364,2365,2366,2367,2368,2369,2370,2